          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "പതിപ്പ് — patippŭ — \"an edition; an issue\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ആ പുസ്തകത്തിന്റെ പുതിയ പതിപ്പ് ഇന്നലെ വന്നു. ā pustakattinṟe putiya patippŭ innale vannu. A new edition of that book came out yesterday."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Also one issue of a paper or a magazine: ഇന്നത്തെ പതിപ്പ് (patippŭ), today's issue."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "പതിപ്പ് (patippŭ) is native Dravidian, a noun built on പതിക്കുക (patikkuka), \"to imprint, to stamp\" (DEDR 3911), with the noun ending -പ്പ്. An edition is one pressing of the type."
            }
          ]
        },
